First, you will draw sides.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.620
For the Master match, 
these two envelopes contain

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:26.190
"The fall paddy shacks" 
and "May the scarlet."

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>Emperor Tenji 
The fall paddy shacks have rough thatching 
as my sleeves are wet with dew</i>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:31.570
<i>Minister of the Right Sanjo 
May the scarlet kadsuras of Mount 
Afusaka live up to their name 
and allow us this secret rendezvous</i>

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:29.370
You will add the card you 
draw to your layout.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.210
In the second match, you will switch.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:33.900
<i>Minister of the Right Sanjo 
May the scarlet kadsuras of Mount Afusaka live up to their name 
and allow us this secret rendezvous</i>

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.150
<i>Emperor Tenji 
The fall paddy shacks have rough thatching 
as my sleeves are wet with dew</i>

