<i>If Dr. Harada wins, or even if he loses,</i>

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:13.220
<i>Suo-san will retire.</i>

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:14.840
<i>I'm glad.</i>

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:17.950
<i>I'm glad...</i>

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.150
<i>I'm... glad?</i>

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:27.530
